The files in this directory are unmodified copies of published npm packages, used as test
inputs only. untwist reads them as text and bytes; nothing here is run.

argon2-bundled.min.js
  from argon2-browser 1.18.0 (https://registry.npmjs.org/argon2-browser/-/argon2-browser-1.18.0.tgz),
  dist/argon2-bundled.min.js: Emscripten glue with its wasm module inlined as base64, bundled and
  minified by webpack. The wasm holds the Argon2 reference implementation (CC0-1.0 or Apache-2.0).
